athon","title":"Stay on Your Feet for IUDM","subtitle":"A 36-hour student fundraiser honoring Ryan White","notes":"Apply through an official dancer team or committee, learn the event’s mission, and prepare for games, speakers, and performances.","short_summary":"A year of student fundraising culminates in 36 hours on foot for Riley Hospital families and pediatric research.","evidence_claim":"IU’s student-organization page says IUDM was founded in 1991 and concludes with a 36-hour event where more than 2,500 students stay on their feet.","source_url":"https://beinvolved.bloomington.iu.edu/organization/iudm","source_title":"Indiana University Dance Marathon","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Participation requires an official IUDM role or invitation; use the organization’s current application and event guidance.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"iu-candy-stripes","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"IU Candy Stripes","title":"Spot the Candy-Striped Warm-Ups","subtitle":"Crimson-and-white stripes adopted by basketball in 1971–72","notes":"At an IU basketball event, look for the striped warm-up pants and photograph the pattern before play begins, when permitted.","short_summary":"A poolside visibility solution became the unmistakable warm-up pattern of Indiana basketball.","evidence_claim":"Indiana Athletics documents that IU basketball adopted candy-striped warm-ups in 1971–72 after the design originated with IU swimming and diving.","source_url":"https://iuhoosiers.com/sports/2023/10/23/basketball-game-day-traditions","source_title":"Basketball Game Day Traditions","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2023-10-23","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The warm-ups are visible at applicable athletics events; tickets, photography rule